                <start-time>00:00:00,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:05,221</end-time>
                <translation>为什么战争会卷入国民的生活？</translation>
                <original>なぜ戦争は国民の生活を巻き込むことになったのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="2" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:09,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:12,725</end-time>
                <translation>法国人类学家罗歇·凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>フランスの人類学者ロジェ・カイヨワは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="3" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:12,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:15,325</end-time>
                <translation>在其著作《战争论》中
その著書《戦争論》で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="4" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:15,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:19,650</end-time>
                <translation>“文明越发展 战争就越激烈”</translation>
                <original>戦争は文明が発展すればするほど激しくなる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="5" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:19,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:21,540</end-time>
                <translation>直面了这一矛盾</translation>
                <original>という矛盾に向き合いました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="6" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:25,165</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:27,844</end-time>
                <translation>是什么？最终导致第一次世界大战
最終的に第一次大戦</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="7" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:27,844</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:29,825</end-time>
                <translation>和第二次世界大战
第二次大戦という</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="8" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:29,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:33,769</end-time>
                <translation>这种波及全世界的总体战的因素
全世界を巻き込む全体戦争を招いた要因を</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="9" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:33,769</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:35,320</end-time>
                <translation>便是他持续探寻的目的</translation>
                <original>探り続けたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="10" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:38,095</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:40,400</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著</translation>
                <original>100分de名著</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" hasRuby="0" index="11" vertical="0" time="" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:40,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:46,905</end-time>
                <translation>为何无法阻止所有人生活卷入总体战？</translation>
                <original>人々の生活すべてを巻き込む全体戦争はなぜ止められなかったのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
